* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-hrát.ogg|audio}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|hrát}}
* {{rhymes|cs|aːt|s=1}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=impf}}

# {{lb|cs|transitive}} to [[play]] {{gloss|a game}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Pojďme '''hrát''' Monopoly.|Let's go and play Monopoly.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Hrajeme''' na schovávanou.|We're playing hide and seek.}}
# {{lb|cs|transitive}} to [[play]] {{gloss|a role}}
# {{lb|cs|transitive}} to [[play]] {{gloss|a musical instrument}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Hraji''' na kytaru.|I play the guitar.}}
# to use a toy
#: {{coi|cs|'''hrát''' s panenkou|to play with a doll}}

